UID:40@default
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Mike Moloney is a volunteer member of the US Coast Guard, Auxiliary, Casco Bay Flotilla. He is an avid kayaker for almost 40 years. Mike is an ACA level 1 &amp; 2 Coastal Kayaking Instructor. Mike's passion is teaching people about how to have fun and stay safe on the water. This is a free 2-hour class loaded whit safety tips&nbsp; for enjoy the local waters, include trip preparation, float plans, safety gear, communication, and visibility.
