DESCRIPTION:"I AM JAYVYN" is a powerful historical novel about a boy&rsquo;s resilience and survival. In 1710, twelve-year-old Jayvyn is taken from his home and forced into an unfamiliar world, enduring hardships in Barbados and South Carolina while forming deep bonds and navigating life in captivity. Amid challenges, he discovers strength, hope, and the power of the human spirit. The book&rsquo;s author, Peter D. Brown, is a Maine-based historical fiction writer with a deep interest in social justice and a passion for preserving history. Living in a quiet township in Maine with his wife and two dogs, he finds inspiration in the peaceful surroundings to bring his stories to life. for more information visit https://peter-d-brown.com/
