DESCRIPTION:Meditate for Mindfulness -Every Thursday in May from 12:30-1:15.&nbsp;Enjoy the ancient sitting practice of Mindfulness Meditation in a group lead by local Meditation Guide and Instructor; Taintor Davis Child.&nbsp;Regular practice of Mindfulness Meditation helps to reveal our patterns of thinking and invites the heart to soften and the mind to open.&nbsp;Beginners and experienced meditators are welcome! Chairs and yoga blocks provided. Arrive by 12:30 to begin settling in. Doors close by 12:40 when instruction begins for a silent sitting practice of 20 minutes, followed by a few minutes for questions. Join in for a gentle pause in your day!&nbsp;
