BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:160@default
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Finding Missing Peace is about a life-changing journey sparked by a dire medical diagnosis that led one woman to search for her birth family&mdash;and ultimately, for herself. What began as a desperate quest for answers hidden in sealed adoption records became a deep, multidimensional healing odyssey. Blending science with spirituality, intuition, and unconventional tools, she discovered that the peace she was seeking wasn&rsquo;t just in her past, but within her all along.Chris Duffy-Wentzel supports women and adult adoptees who are seeking a life reinvention as a result of triggering anxiety, uncertainty, self-judgments and disappointments. A pre-surgery consultant as well as a certified personal development and career coach, her process weaves together mindful journeying, brain science and sacred healing arts to help build more confidence, self-acceptance, joy and well-being. Find Chris online.
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261111T111128Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20250716T220000Z
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20250716T230000Z
LOCATION:none
SUMMARY;LANGUAGE=en-us:Author Visit -Chris Duffy-Wentzel
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
