DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to invite you to an intimate reading with our very own Mary Lou Bagley, an author celebrated for her inviting nature and captivating storytelling. Immerse yourself in the charm of her novels, Other Wise, This Other Way of Knowing, and her newest release, Love &amp; Other Matters.Dive into the world of Margaret Meader, a woman with second sight, and meet the rich cast of characters that bring her story to life. Mary Lou, drawing on her experience as a teacher, workshop leader, and seasoned actress, will bring her stories to life and offer fascinating insights into the writing process.The event will feature a lively reading, an inspiring Q&amp;A session, and an opportunity for book signing. Don&rsquo;t miss this chance to connect with Mary Lou and explore her literary world!
