UID:184@default
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we feature another local author!Sandra D. Alexander first started writing using it as a safe space. Her journaling became her best friend as life at home grew dark and emotionally confining. After a promise made to her dying brother and managing to flee a very toxic environment, Alexander transcribed her journals into the publication, Sticks and Stones. Sandra&rsquo;s account will remind you that relationships are complex; that the people we know in public may be entirely different people at home. Sticks and Stones is a story of faith in God and commitment to integrity, values, and morals in the face of devastating abuse. Sticks and Stones is also currently being adapted into a Lifetime film.
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261111T111128Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20250820T220000Z
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20250820T230000Z
LOCATION:none
SUMMARY;LANGUAGE=en-us:Author Visit: Sandra D. Alexander
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
