DESCRIPTION:In this presentation, we will look at uncovering budget-friendly tips, kitchen hacks, ways to transform your pantry, and learn to promote nutrient dense options as well as recipe resources.Marianne Evans-Ramsay, RD, CDCES, LDN is a registered dietician/nutritionist with a passion for home economics and community nutrition. In this informative program, Marianne will be exploring ideas on how to overcome the barriers to eating well on a modest budget. The program will focus on tapping into one's priorities and looking at strategies to make better and more creative decisions when it comes to food.
