DESCRIPTION:Join herbalist Brenna Lilly of Brisingamen Botanicals for a workshop on the principles of blending your own herbal teas using the power of intuition. Brenna believes that herbalism should be available to everyone, and that teas can help facilitate deep healing in accessible ways. Participants will leave with a bag of their own intuitively blended herbal tea to enjoy at home.What Is Intuitive Herbal Tea Blending?Intuitive herbal tea blending is a perspective on herbal tea blending that allows us to tap into our inner wisdom and the &ldquo;wise woman/man/person within&rdquo; and create tea blends that nourish the body, mind, and spirit. Everyone accesses their intuition differently to decide which herbs and what amount of them to include in a delicious tea blend; some folks utilize meditation and prayer, while others like to use divinatory tools such as pendulums, tarot or oracle cards, and dowsing/muscle testing.Why Intuitive Herbal Tea Blending?Using our intuition helps us to trust ourselves and build resilience. It also helps us connect with the subconscious and unconscious aspects of our minds where wisdom can live beyond our doubts and fears. In the realm of herbalism, intuition (when supplemented by research, understanding of herbal contraindications, and the advice of medical professionals) can help us find remedies that may be right for us, and help us better understand ourselves and the healing plants.
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261111T111128Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260520T213000Z
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260520T223000Z
LOCATION:none
SUMMARY;LANGUAGE=en-us:Intuitive Tea Blending with Brenna Lilly
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
